           ("tf", "The traders who refuse are respecting their duty to protect the environment.", False, "They are failing the duty to protect the common environment.", {}),
           ("mcq", "Which action would help solve the problem?", "Dialogue to explain the benefits and organise rotas", ["Violence against traders", "Ignoring the problem", "Burning all rubbish in the market"], "Peaceful dialogue and cooperation work best.", {}),
